OL,3,GNEWSACouple ordered to cut hedge after
OL,4,Aclaiming it was not a hedge
OL,5,
OL,6,FA couple has been ordered to reduce the
OL,7,Fsize of their hedge after they claimed
OL,8,Fit was not a hedge at all.
OL,10,FProf Angus Macdonald and Dr Patricia
OL,11,FMacdonald received a notice from East
OL,12,FLothian Council after neighbours
OL,13,Fcomplained the trees and shrubs were
OL,14,Foverhanging onto their property,
OL,15,Fshedding branches, leaves and berries,
OL,16,Fand blocking out the sky.
OL,18,FThe couple appealed to Scottish
OL,19,Fministers and insisted the description
OL,20,Fof the boundary plants was wrong,
OL,21,Fclaiming it was actually a mixture of
OL,22,F17 closely planted trees and shrubs.
OL,23,APub: 18-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
FL,430,420,260,160,0,100
