OL,3,GNEWSACouple ordered to cut hedge after
OL,4,Aclaiming it was not a hedge
OL,5,
OL,6,FBut the Scottish government reporter
OL,7,Fstated the plants met the definition of
OL,8,Fa high hedge in Scotland and ruled in
OL,9,Ffavour of the council.
